{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '35324,35336p' src/ontology/cl-edit.owl\"","aggregated_output":"\n# Class: obo:CL_4072022 (Lamp5 Lhx6 GABAergic interneuron (Homo sapiens))\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:30382198\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:36007006\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37824655\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37824669\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:38712198\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4072022 \"A Lamp5 Lhx6 GABAergic interneuron of Homo sapiens. The standard transcriptomic reference data for this cell type can be found on the CellxGene census under the collection: 'Transcriptomic cytoarchitecture reveals principles of human neocortex organization', dataset: 'Supercluster: CGE-derived interneurons', Author Categories: 'CrossArea_subclass', Lamp5 Lhx6\")\nAnnotationAssertion(obo:RO_0002175 obo:CL_4072022 obo:NCBITaxon_9606)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4072022 \"2025-07-31T14:01:52Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_4072022 \"https://cellxgene.cziscience.com/e/e4ddac12-f48f-4455-8e8d-c2a48a683437.cxg/\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32999462\") rdfs:comment obo:CL_4072022 \"Despite being clustered as CGE in this dataset, other studies suggest that the cell is of MGE origin because it expresses transcription factors such as LHX6 and NKX2-1, which are hallmark indicators of MGE-derived interneurons. Fate mapping experiments in mice have demonstrated that Lamp5+/Lhx6+ interneurons in both the hippocampus and neocortex arise from the MGE, and single-cell transcriptomic comparisons further show that primate neocortical Lamp5+/Lhx6+ cells closely resemble mouse hippocampal MGE-derived interneurons rather than classic CGE-derived types.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://zenodo.org/records/11165918\") rdfs:comment obo:CL_4072022 \"The marker set CHST9, LAMP5 can identify the Human cell type Lamp5 Lhx6 neuron in the neocortex with a confidence of 0.821678322 (NS-Forest FBeta value).\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072022 \"Lamp5 Lhx6 GABAergic interneuron (Homo sapiens)\")\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4072022 obo:CL_4042013)\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4072022 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0000203))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4072022 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002162 obo:NCBITaxon_9606))\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
