L_4033034\tSLC35F4\tSLC35F4\tThis IMB type is annotated by the marker SLC35F4.\n\tOFFx\tOFFx cell\tCL_4033036\tFEZF1\tFEZF1\tOFFx is annotated by FEZF1.\n\tOFFx cell\tOFFx cell\tCL_4033036\tFEZF1\tFEZF1\tOFFx is annotated by FEZF1.\n\tRB\trod bipolar cell\tCL_0000751\tPRKCA\tPRKCA\tThis RB type is annotated by the marker PRKCA.\n\tdiffuse bipolar 1 cell\tdiffuse bipolar 1 cell\tCL_4033027\tEBF1\tEBF1\tThe diffuse bipolar 1 (DB1) is annotated by the marker EBF1.\n\tdiffuse bipolar 2 cell\tdiffuse bipolar 2 cell\tCL_4033028\tCOL5A1\tCOL5A1\tThis DB2 type is annotated by marker COL5A1.\n\tdiffuse bipolar 3a cell\tdiffuse bipolar 3a cell\tCL_4033029\tDPP6\tDPP6\tThe diffuse bipolar 3a (DB3a) can be annotated by the marker DPP6.\n\tdiffuse bipolar 3b cell\tdiffuse bipolar 3b cell\tCL_4033030\tMEIS2\tMEIS2\tThe diffuse bipolar 3b (DB3b) is annotated by MEIS2.\n\tdiffuse bipolar 4 cell\tdiffuse bipolar 4 cell\tCL_4033031\tTTR , PRSS12\tunknown\tThe diffuse bipolar 4 (DB4) has two types, DB4a and DB4b. Currently, there exists an Cell Ontology term for DB4, but not for DB4a and DB4b. Two Cell Onotology Terms can be added to the Cell Ontology database. DB4a can be annotated by the marker TTR, and DB4b can be annotated by the marker PRSS12.\n\tdiffuse bipolar 5\tretinal bipolar neuron\tCL_0000748\tMYO16\tMYO16\tThe diffuse bipolar 5 (DB5) is a bipolar type that does not have an existing Cell Ontology term. This term can be added to the Cell Ontology database. DB5 can be annodated by the marker MYO16.\n\tdiffuse bipolar 6 cell\tdiffuse bipolar 6 cell\tCL_4033032\tLRRC4C\tLRRC4C\tThe diffuse bipolar 6 (DB6) is annotated by the marker LRRC4C.\n\tflat midget bipolar cell\tflat midget bipolar cell\tCL_4033033\tSCG2\tSCG2\tThis FMB type is annotated by marker SCG2.\n\tgiant bipolar cell\tgiant bipolar cell\tCL_4033035\tAGBL1\tunknown\tThe cone giant bipolar (GB) is annotated by the marker AGBL1. The marker PCDH11X is used for both giant bipolar and blue bipolar.\n\tinvaginating midget bipolar cell\tinvaginating midget bipolar cell\tCL_4033034\tSLC35F4\tSLC35F4\tThis IMB type is annotated by the gene marker SLC35F4.\n\trod bipolar cell\trod bipolar cell\tCL_0000751\tPRKCA\tPRKCA\tThis RB type is annotated by marker PRKCA.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
